text = "Step on up to The Choicer Voicer game show studio!
Each round, a voice clip will play for you. Impersonate the
audio as well as you can.

Assign up to five Twitch usernames to your judge panel.
They determine your fate by voting in chat.

End with an average of 60% or higher to win!"

